Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:08.36,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Oh my. I'm surprised to \Nsee someone else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.85,0:00:11.28,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:12.21,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:16.60,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The Tarasque Swamp isn't a \Nplace for a normal person...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:19.08,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Particularly not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:24.34,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,You seem to be implying you're not normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:28.99,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,I simply possess a magic \Nitem that nullifies poison,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:31.51,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,and holy water that drives Tarasques away,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.51,0:00:34.92,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,as well as an accurate map.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:38.44,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,I'm after the Dragonblood flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.93,0:00:41.43,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,You don't mind if I take some, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.96,0:00:42.93,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.55,0:00:53.26,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm surely the one who's not normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.37,0:02:35.55,Title,Rentt,0,0,0,,{\an1\shad0\bord2\fs17\fade(1000,400)\c&H4E4E56&\3c&HD2D2D2&\b1\pos(482.676,49.279)}A Strange Man\Nand a Strange Job
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.91,0:02:36.58,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Is that all you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:38.50,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.82,0:02:44.13,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,My mistress wants the \NDragonblood flower itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:47.74,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,The medicine you make from \Nthese will last a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.74,0:02:50.32,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,but the flowers themselves won't \Nif they're plucked, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:51.68,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.32,0:02:56.57,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for prying, but \Nis your mistress badly ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.96,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Yes, I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.96,0:03:01.75,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,I'd like to stay by their side,\Ntaking care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:04.44,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I know this doesn't help, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:07.15,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I hope they get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.84,0:03:09.74,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.13,0:03:15.28,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,I and my mistress were fortunate I \Nwas able to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.93,0:03:18.64,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,I was just looking for someone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:23.09,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,who could bring us Dragonblood \Nflowers at regular intervals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.58,0:03:27.00,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,It's silly to be asking this now, \Nbut you're an adventurer, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:30.76,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm Rentt Vivie. A \NBronze-class adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.51,0:03:33.82,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Bronze-class?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:35.13,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Have you changed your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:37.02,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:39.64,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,I'm certain you're strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:43.78,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,If the pay and conditions are to your liking,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.78,0:03:47.16,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,I would appreciate it if you would accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.06,0:03:49.52,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:52.13,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,We'll make the arrangements \Nafter our return, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.13,0:03:54.70,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Oh, I haven't introduced myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:57.61,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,I'm Isaac Hart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:04:00.04,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,As for my mistress...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:03.73,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,I'll introduce you after the \Narrangements are finalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:11.89,Main,Man,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you were so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:15.73,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Not many people come back \Nfrom that swamp unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.09,0:04:20.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Actually, this mask is just \Na way to hide my identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:24.37,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm actually a Mythril-class adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:28.87,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Make sure you hire me next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:30.61,Main,Man,0,0,0,,I'll give you a discount!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.49,0:04:34.74,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:39.66,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'd like to return this magic bag and \Nhire someone to butcher a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:41.14,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Butcher...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.51,0:04:43.63,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Did you defeat one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.65,0:04:51.35,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,There's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:52.70,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:55.77,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I'll show you to the Butcher's, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.01,0:04:59.18,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,A monster doesn't just drop magic stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.18,0:05:01.73,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Their bodies can be butchered to \Nprovide many different materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:05.47,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I learned how to do the basics myself when I \Nwas learning to be a hunter in the village,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:10.59,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,but for things I can't handle, I pay \Nthe money to hire a specialist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.99,0:05:15.55,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Dario!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.93,0:05:18.15,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:19.31,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:23.89,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Rentt here has brought \Nsomething unusual for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.02,0:05:26.71,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,A Tarasque!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.10,0:05:28.36,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,A Tarasque?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.75,0:05:33.85,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,Okay, bring it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:36.29,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Will Edel be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:38.56,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Edel's resistant to poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:50.87,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,It's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.39,0:05:54.08,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,And in good shape, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:56.16,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,Not a single wound on the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.16,0:05:57.57,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,That's rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.57,0:05:59.08,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:00.14,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:02.36,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,The normal way to fight \None of these is to attack
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:04.88,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,from outside the range of \Nits poison to weaken it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:07.78,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,So the shell always gets damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:09.72,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.72,0:06:13.37,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,You killed it in basically \Na single hit, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.37,0:06:15.59,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,A {\i1}single{\i0} hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.59,0:06:18.75,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I just didn't have time \Nto land multiple hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:20.82,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,Don't be so humble!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:24.21,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,I haven't seen a Tarasque \Nof this quality in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:26.59,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Will it be worth a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:27.65,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:30.07,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Can I ask you to handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:31.23,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.23,0:06:32.86,Main,Dario,0,0,0,,Look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:34.63,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.97,0:06:42.15,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I guess I'll go to the orphanage tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:44.29,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thanks for staying out so late with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:45.42,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.42,0:06:50.17,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Anyway, Rentt, you've gotten \Na lot stronger, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:52.17,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.17,0:06:55.46,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You defeated that huge \NTarasque all by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:57.37,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You're at the high end of Bronze...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:07:00.57,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,No, you could easily be Silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:02.66,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You should remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:12.91,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I do feel stronger, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:19.74,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But saying that I, myself, have \Ngotten stronger feels weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:23.74,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Isaac doesn't seem to be an adventurer,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:28.17,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,but he's probably got the strength of a \NSilver-class, or probably close to Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:32.83,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I just took advantage of my undead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:40.80,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,This strength is something I got \Njust by becoming a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:44.01,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Of course, I want to go back to being human.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.62,0:07:50.26,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But without this power, I'll go \Nback to who I was then, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:54.02,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,10 years... 10 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.75,0:07:57.22,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,With no talent, no improvement...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.22,0:08:00.04,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Where putting in effort each \Nday was all I could do...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.67,0:08:05.95,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Could I go back to that and \Nstill try to become Mythril?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:20.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,This is fine. I've got just the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:24.05,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Perfectly done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:26.36,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,What's perfectly done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:29.22,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.22,0:08:30.87,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:35.83,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,This is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.83,0:08:37.37,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I've never seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.69,0:08:39.31,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.31,0:08:41.14,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,This is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:45.15,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,It's rare to see one that's \Nbeen prepared so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.15,0:08:46.57,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.57,0:08:50.58,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The only adventurers who go to the Tarasque \Nswamp are of fairly high rank, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.01,0:08:53.87,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,They should all know how \Nto properly prepare herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:56.16,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,Well, just because of the \Nkind of place it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:58.94,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,there's not a lot of time \Nto do things properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.94,0:09:02.05,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,Sometimes you can get attacked \Nby a Tarasque on your way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.05,0:09:05.88,Main,Umberto,0,0,0,,You must be a powerful adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:08.57,Main,Umberto,0,0,0,,I'm Umberto, the healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:09.78,Main,Umberto,0,0,0,,And this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:11.79,Main,Normal,0,0,0,,Norman. An herbalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.79,0:09:14.68,Main,Normal,0,0,0,,Wow, with something of this quality
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:17.57,Main,Normal,0,0,0,,I can make a medicine to treat \NMalaccumula really quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.57,0:09:18.59,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.59,0:09:23.11,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,Yes. If there's any left over, can I use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.11,0:09:24.77,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,There are people who need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:26.49,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Of course. I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.99,0:09:28.57,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Do you want more?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.95,0:09:31.47,Main,Umberto,0,0,0,,Of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:34.29,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,I'd be lying if I said I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:36.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Is this enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.11,0:09:40.48,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No need to pay me. Just put it to good use.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:45.06,Main,Umberto,0,0,0,,You sure? This would be \Nworth a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.47,0:09:47.60,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's nice to just help \Npeople, once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.97,0:09:50.60,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,Thank you. This is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:54.82,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,I'll be able to save so \Nmany lives with these...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:56.87,Main,Umberto,0,0,0,,We can't repay you right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.87,0:09:59.73,Main,Umberto,0,0,0,,but if you need something \Nin the future, tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.73,0:10:00.62,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.19,0:10:11.37,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,And there we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.69,0:10:15.17,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,This completes the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:16.14,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:18.40,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:19.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.67,0:10:20.82,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:24.33,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I'm the one who has to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:26.54,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I can't thank you enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.11,0:10:32.86,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I was going to become an adventurer and \Nget it myself if nobody took the job...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:34.82,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,But I don't think that would've worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:37.52,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You no longer want to be an adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.90,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I actually want to be one even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.52,0:10:43.78,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Rentt...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:46.34,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I want to be an adventurer like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.75,0:10:51.13,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,One who can help people!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.48,0:10:52.45,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:54.40,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:57.95,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I can't do anything to thank you, but if...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.97,0:11:03.48,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do \Nto help you, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:05.07,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.94,0:11:09.54,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,There are times when I need help, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.99,0:11:12.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,When that happens, I'll come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.72,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Great! You'd better!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:17.49,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:20.99,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Was everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:27.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Alize, you said there were sometimes \Nsmall monsters in the basement, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.51,0:11:29.75,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Yes. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:32.61,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Edel's old gang will protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:35.49,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Gang... Of puchi suri?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.37,0:11:38.09,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.09,0:11:39.73,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Thank you, Edel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:43.06,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,That's so great...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.06,0:11:47.88,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll be able to tame monsters \Nlike this when I become an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:53.52,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Anyway, if you want to be an adventurer, \Nyou should start training early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:54.79,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Training?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.79,0:11:56.83,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The guild holds classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:12:00.14,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,And I can train you too, when I have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:01.49,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:06.19,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,If you have mana, you should \Nlearn to use magic, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.19,0:12:09.25,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,But I don't have money...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.25,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,It's expensive to train with a sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:16.09,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,but training to learn magic \Ncosts even more, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:19.07,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I've got a friend who's not \Ndoing anything with her time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:20.59,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.59,0:12:22.05,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,That won't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:24.87,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I can't count on you for that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:27.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Then I'll lend you the \Nmoney, with no interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.79,0:12:33.06,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,When you become an adventurer and \Nstart earning money, pay me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.39,0:12:38.36,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I'll pay it back with interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.87,0:12:39.97,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:43.04,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,We have a deal, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:49.09,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I look forward to doing \Nbusiness with you, Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:54.84,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I don't mind teaching her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:58.22,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,There are indeed times when \NI'm "not doing anything."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.15,0:13:02.31,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,As you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.31,0:13:06.44,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sorry... I meant when you're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.44,0:13:09.41,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You should be careful with your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:13.19,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You don't understand how young girls feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:18.15,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thanks for the warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.15,0:13:22.65,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I have very few interactions \Nwith young girls, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:25.13,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Come on, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:27.79,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,There's a young girl you know quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.45,0:13:30.42,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.19,0:13:32.99,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:40.02,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I just remembered about this extremely \Npowerful spell I just developed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:41.68,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,L-Lorraine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:47.17,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Let's see just how much that \Nundead body of yours can take!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.17,0:13:49.25,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Wait! You're young!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.25,0:13:51.15,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You're very young, Lorraine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:54.00,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Your skin is as fair as driven snow...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:57.97,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,And your statuesque figure...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:02.16,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Even the water fairies created \Nby the goddess of beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.16,0:14:06.13,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,as the physical manifestation of \Nher virtue would bow their heads
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.13,0:14:08.20,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,at the sight of your gorgeous face!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:13.63,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You are the very picture of a young \Ngirl in every way, Lorraine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.61,0:14:20.17,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Where the hell did you \Nlearn to talk like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.17,0:14:24.26,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you say that \Nto every girl you meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:25.89,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Of course I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.54,0:14:27.80,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:30.60,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I just said what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:36.04,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You'd like a little more to eat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:36.93,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:39.14,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'll bring you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.13,0:14:44.60,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I split the pots between the one \Nwith blood and the one without.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.55,0:14:54.85,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I think that got to me a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:08.91,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Why am I the only one working \Nwhen I'm the master?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:10.88,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:12.76,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.76,0:15:14.46,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:15.91,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:21.06,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:26.54,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Um, Rentt, did you know anyone \Nin the Latour household?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:28.05,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The Latour household?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.05,0:15:29.61,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.09,0:15:31.79,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I've never heard the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.85,0:15:37.14,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,There's actually a job \Nrequesting you specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.07,0:15:41.63,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Oh, the one from Isaac?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.63,0:15:44.49,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,So you do know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:46.12,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:53.53,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I just know a man who I assume is a \Nservant of this Latour Household.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.71,0:15:57.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Is the family that famous?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.31,0:16:01.37,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'd like to think I know most of \Nwhat there is to know about Maalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:03.76,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I know little about them, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.08,0:16:10.87,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,They're not nobles, but they're a very old \Nhouse with a lot of influence over Maalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:16.70,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Someone of my lowly station \Nwouldn't be told any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:19.46,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So they're very secretive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.46,0:16:24.29,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Each generation's guild master \Nis told to be very careful
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:26.92,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,not to offend the Latour household.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.66,0:16:30.58,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Rentt, if you're going to live here in Maalt,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.58,0:16:33.72,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,you absolutely cannot refuse \Na request from the Latours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:36.26,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I have no intention of refusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.26,0:16:39.29,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,But... is it okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.21,0:16:42.76,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Um... you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:47.57,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,If they find out I'm a \Nmonster, they'll kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.95,0:16:50.13,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,It's going to be hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:56.62,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, when I met Isaac, he didn't \Nseem to care about my appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:59.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,If it was an issue, he wouldn't \Nhave made the request at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.23,0:17:02.68,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:05.52,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,But if there's any problem at all, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.52,0:17:09.01,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Of course. I'll start \Nby paying them a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.46,0:17:15.54,Main,Umberto,0,0,0,,We've come to talk about \Nyour condition today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:20.72,Main,Umberto,0,0,0,,You're sick with Malaccumula.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:25.56,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,So it's as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:30.02,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,I'll need to tell the Church \Nto send a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:34.15,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:36.12,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:40.11,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,A medicine made from Dragonblood flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.07,0:17:43.87,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,Take one pill a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.87,0:17:48.43,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,Little by little, it will dissolve \Nthe foulness building within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.73,0:17:52.43,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,I appreciate it, but this \Nis so expensive, and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.43,0:17:55.76,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Headmistress Lilian, you don't \Nneed to worry about the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.12,0:17:58.66,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,So please...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:02.55,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Please get better soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.47,0:18:04.84,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,Alize...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:09.20,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,Umberto, don't tell me \N{\i1}you{\i0} got this flower...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.20,0:18:13.78,Main,Umberto,0,0,0,,I did used to be an adventurer, but \Nsomebody like me could never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:18.94,Main,Norman,0,0,0,,An adventurer took the job from Alize, \Nfor the price of one bronze piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:23.54,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:26.82,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,It was the one who came \Nhere that day, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:47.71,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Excuse me... is Isaac in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:50.82,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,Yes. He's in the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:53.34,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,Please, go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:55.40,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It looks like there's a maze...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:58.12,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,Yes. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.79,0:19:02.21,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Even if I was told to come here for a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.84,0:19:04.09,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.77,0:19:08.58,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Do maps cost money?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:11.15,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,There'd be no point in having one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:16.09,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,A special magic item was \Nused to make this garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.09,0:19:18.47,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,The path changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.47,0:19:20.90,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,There's an item that can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:23.80,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No... even if it exists, that's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.19,0:19:28.79,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,The heads of the Latour family have \Nalways collected magic items.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:33.06,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,I'm told that this item was \Na part of their collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.76,0:19:38.23,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't like the fact that I have to \Nmake it past one of their hobbies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.23,0:19:41.01,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,Even if I told you there's a reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:42.15,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:47.05,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,Those who make it through the \Nmaze and reach the mansion
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.05,0:19:50.65,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,can receive a magic item from \Nthe head of the household.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.65,0:19:51.92,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.66,0:19:57.33,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,The entrance to the maze is only opened \Nrarely, at the whim of the head of household.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:20:00.39,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's the case today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:03.60,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thanks for telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:05.73,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,One more thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.73,0:20:09.23,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask something from someone who \NI assume has completed the maze himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.23,0:20:10.13,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:13.03,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Any advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:15.62,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:20.69,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,The sun won't help you. I suppose \Nthat's enough of a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.11,0:20:24.33,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.49,0:20:28.61,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.19,0:20:37.38,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,They're giving me a magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:39.63,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Of course I'm going to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.54,0:20:45.31,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Even this cursed mask is a magic item...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:47.53,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,And it wouldn't be cheap \Nif I bought it normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:51.51,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,If I can get a powerful magic item...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.15,0:20:56.19,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I need money and equipment if I'm \Ngoing to become Mythril-class, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:26.70,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,No luck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:32.07,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Even though a magic item made this place, \NI suppose it won't work since it's not a labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:36.08,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's fine. I've got a \Ngood sense of direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.81,0:21:40.77,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I can draw a mental map that's more \Nthan enough for a maze of this size...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:03.55,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm totally lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:40.01,Title,Rentt,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord2\fs33\c&H2B2C54&\3c&HC5E4F6&\b0\pos(185.032,271.572)}The Garden Labyrinth
